<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bg">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>PhoneTradeBG – Търговия с телефони</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; }
    header { background:#0056a6; color:#fff; padding:20px; text-align:center; }
    .products { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:20px; gap:20px; }
    .product { border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px; width:calc(33% - 40px); box-sizing:border-box; }
    .product img { width:100%; height:auto; }
    .contact { padding:20px; background:#f9f9f9; }
    .contact form { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; max-width:400px; }
    footer { background:#333; color:#fff; padding:10px; text-align:center; }
    a.social { color:#fff; margin: 0 5px; text-decoration:none;}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>PhoneTradeBG</h1>
    <p>Купи и продай смартфон бързо и лесно</p>
  </header>
  <section class="products">
    <div class="product">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="iPhone 15 Pro Max">
      <h3>iPhone 15 Pro Max</h3><p>256 GB • Син цвят • Ново</p><p><strong>1499 лв</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="product">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="Samsung Galaxy S23">
      <h3>Samsung Galaxy S23</h3><p>128 GB • Черен • Реновиран</p><p><strong>649 лв</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="product">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300x200" alt="iPhone 14 Plus">
      <h3>iPhone 14 Plus</h3><p>128 GB • Жълт • Реновиран</p><p><strong>749 лв</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="contact">
    <h2>Свържи се с нас</h2>
    <form action="#" method="post">
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Име" required>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Имейл" required>
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Съобщение..." required></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Изпрати</button>
    </form>
    <p>Телефон: +359 88 123 4567<br>Имейл: info@phonetradebg.com</p>
  </section>
  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 PhoneTradeBG</p>
    <a class="social" href="#">Facebook</a>|
    <a class="social" href="#">Instagram</a>|
    <a class="social" href="#">Viber</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
